# A13: nothing that is a COPY of a tracked file, or a run artifact, may be
# committed again. dashboard/plugin_api.py.bak (a stale duplicate of a live
# module, 8.5K of divergent routes), plugin.yaml.bak.20260625_114235 (a manifest
# with a stale version, next to the manifest that carries the real one) and
# ctx_eval_r2.log (one gate run's output) were all tracked and would all have
# shipped in a release tarball.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej
*.log

# scripts/bench_a5_vectors.py's default store, now that its default is inside
# the repo rather than an absolute path in one developer's home directory.
.a5bench/
dashboard/web/node_modules/
